# O2B Community works entirely locally and needs NO environment variables
# and NO credentials to run `o2b doctor`, `o2b optimize`, or `o2b scan`.
# This file exists to document that explicitly, not because a variable is
# required today.
#
# See docs/PRIVACY.md: 100% local processing, zero network calls, zero
# telemetry. If that ever changes for a Community feature, the required
# variable would be documented here with a comment explaining why it's
# needed and what happens if it's absent — never a live secret value.
#
# (No variables defined below on purpose.)
